    {
      "id": "blackspire_hall_room_0009",
      "title": "Ashencrest Lane",
      "roomType": "",
      "description": "Dark stone workshops press close along this busy lane, their soot-stained walls marked by hanging signs of iron, bone, and carved wood.\nThe clang of metal and harsh voices of traders spill from open doorways while smoke drifts from chimneys overhead.\nA permanent haze of ash seems to cling to the street, lending Ashencrest Lane its grim and fitting name.",
